# Cloud API key for cloud providers (Anthropic, OpenRouter, OpenAI, ...).
#
# To use cloud LLMs:
#   1. Copy this file to config/secrets.cfg  (which is gitignored)
#   2. Paste your key below
#   3. Set provider (and base_url/model where relevant) in config/llm.cfg
#
# Alternatively, skip this file and export the key as the environment variable
# named by api_key_env in llm.cfg — NPC_GAME_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY for
# provider = anthropic, OPENROUTER_API_KEY otherwise. The env var wins when both
# are present. NEVER commit a real key.

api_key = sk-ant-...or-sk-or-...your-key...
